{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>Have I ever been accustomed?</b> The meaning: since the day you rode." "<b>Have I been in the habit — I have been accustomed.</b> The habitual — I have made habitual. And the meaning: thus were my habits of association with you, and intact [i.e., unbroken]."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:57.927598784Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}